CONTEXT Orchard IN ENGLISH
-- An existing system with a typology in one wide table. A lemon is a citrus and a fruit,
-- so its row names it in the columns of all three concepts.

CLASSIFY Lemon, Orange ISA Citrus
CLASSIFY Citrus ISA Fruit
RELATION weight[Fruit*Gram] [UNI]
RELATION picker[Fruit*Picker]

POPULATION Lemon CONTAINS [ "l1" ]
POPULATION weight CONTAINS [ ("l1", "90") ]

ENDCONTEXT
